   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "d2477af4",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## 🧠 The 5-Step Method (har class mein yahi dohrayenge)"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "2f1b8327",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "1. **Restate** — problem ko apne shabdon mein bolo. \"Mujhe kya input mil raha hai, aur kya output chahiye?\"\n",
    "2. **Example first** — ek concrete input lo, use KAAGAZ par HAATH se solve karo. Answer likho.\n",
    "3. **Pseudocode** — solution ke steps **plain English/Hinglish** mein likho. Abhi Python NAHI.\n",
    "4. **Translate** — har English step ko ek Python line mein badlo.\n",
    "5. **Trace (dry run)** — wahi example lo, code ko line-by-line chalao, har variable ki value ek table mein likho.\n"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "a4cfe4a7",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## LOGIC CLASS 1 — Trace First: Code ko \"chalana\" seekho (dimaag mein)\n"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "db57d629",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "### 👨‍🏫 Concept 1 — Trace table kya hai?"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "e5daf91a",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "> **📖 Technical definition — Tracing (dry run):** Tracing is manually stepping through code one line at a time, recording the value of every variable after each line, to predict the program's behavior without running it.\n"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 1,
   "id": "075f2e83",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [
    {
     "name": "stdout",
     "output_type": "stream",
     "text": [
      "3\n",
      "8\n",
      "10\n"
     ]
    }
   ],
   "source": [
    "total = 0\n",
    "for n in [3, 5, 2]:\n",
    "    total = total + n\n",
    "    print(total)    ## >> 10"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "ba058016",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "step  | total | n\n",
    "\n",
    "shuru |   0   | -\n",
    "loop 1|   0   | 3\n",
    "loop 1|   3   | 3\n",
    "loop 2|   3   | 5\n",
    "loop 2|   8   | 5\n",
    "loop 3|   8   | 2\n",
    "loop 3|   10  | 2\n",
    "print |   10  | -"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "ee376e13",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "### 👨‍🏫 Concept 2 — Ab thoda mushkil (nested + if)\n"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 2,
   "id": "1baf059d",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [
    {
     "name": "stdout",
     "output_type": "stream",
     "text": [
      "1\n",
      "2\n",
      "3\n"
     ]
    }
   ],
   "source": [
    "count = 0\n",
    "for word in [\"hi\", \"sun\", \"go\"]:\n",
    "    for letter in word:\n",
    "        if letter in \"aeiou\":\n",
    "            count = count + 1\n",
    "            print(count)"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "7dcadc31",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "step       | count  | word | letter\n",
    "\n",
    "s 1        |    0   |\n",
    "1f-lp1     |    0   |  hi  |   \n",
    "2f-lp1     |    0   |  hi  |   h\n",
    "if         |    0   |  hi  |   h\n",
    "2f-lp2     |    0   |  hi  |   i\n",
    "if         |    1   |  hi  |   i\n",
    "1f-lp2     |    1   |  sun |   i\n",
    "2f-lp1     |    1   |  sun |   s\n",
    "if         |    1   |  sun |   s\n",
    "2f-lp2     |    1   |  sun |   u\n",
    "if         |    2   |  sun |   u\n",
    "2f-lp3     |    2   |  sun |   n\n",
    "if         |    2   |  sun |   n\n",
    "1f-lp3     |    2   |   go |   n\n",
    "2f-lp1     |    2   |   go |   g\n",
    "if         |    2   |   go |   g\n",
    "2f-lp2     |    2   |   go |   o\n",
    "if         |    3   |   go |   o\n",
    "print      |    3   |    - |   -\n"
   ]
  },
